msgstr "Ok op Paneels mit Menübalken anwennen"

#: rc.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Normally if you have the desktop's or current application's menu bar "
"displayed in a panel at the top of the screen (MacOS-style), transparency is "
"disabled for this panel to avoid the desktop background clashing with the "
"menu bar. Set this option to make it transparent anyway."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du den Menübalken vun't aktuelle Programm oder vun den Schriefdisch an "
"de Schirmkant baven hest (as in MacOS), is Transparenz för em normalerwies "
"utmaakt, dormit he goot sichtbor is. Maak dit an, wenn de Balken liekers "
"dörsichtig wesen schall."

