msgid ""
"Here you can set the location on the screen's edge that will bring the panel "
"to the front."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de Steed vun de Schirmkanten fastleggen, de dat Paneel na "
"vörn haalt."

#: rc.cpp:187
msgid "Show panel when switching &desktops"
msgstr "Paneel bi't S&chriefdisch-Wesseln wiesen"

#: rc.cpp:190
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel will automatically show itself for a "
"brief period of time when the desktop is switched so you can see which "
"desktop you are on."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt dat Paneel kort wiest, na dat Du den Schriefdisch "
"wesselt hest. So kannst Du sehn, op welk Schriefdisch Du anlangt büst."

#: rc.cpp:193
msgid "Panel-Hiding Buttons"
msgstr "Utblennknööp"

#: rc.cpp:196
msgid ""
"This option controls the panel-hiding buttons, which are buttons with a "
"small triangle found at the ends of the panel. You can place a button at "
"either end of the panel, or both. Clicking on one of these buttons will hide "
"the panel."
msgstr ""
"Disse Optschoon kuntrulleert de Paneel-Utblennknööp. Dat sünd Knööp mit "
"lütte Dre'ecks dor op, se köönt an beed Ennen vun dat Paneel wiest warrn. "
"Wenn Du dor op klickst, warrt dat Paneel utblendt."

#: rc.cpp:202
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, a panel-hiding button appears on the left end "
"of the panel."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt en Utblennknoop an't linke Enn vun't Paneel wiest."

#: rc.cpp:205
msgid "Show right panel-hiding &button"
msgstr "&Rechten Utblennknoop wiesen"

#: rc.cpp:208
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, a panel-hiding button appears on the right end "
"of the panel."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt en Utblennknoop an't rechte Enn vun't Paneel wiest."

#: rc.cpp:211
msgid "Panel Animation"
msgstr "Paneel-Animatschoon"

#: rc.cpp:214
msgid "A&nimate panel hiding"
msgstr "Utblennen a&nimeren"

#: rc.cpp:217
msgid ""
"When this option is selected the panel will \"slide\" off the screen when "
"hiding. The speed of the animation is controlled by the slider directly "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt dat Paneel bi't Utblennen vun den Schirm glieden. Wo "
"gau dat Glieden geiht, kann mit den Schuver nerrn instellt warrn."

#: rc.cpp:220
msgid "Determines how quickly the panel hides if hiding animation is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, wo gau dat Paneel versteken warrt, wenn de Animatschoon "
"aktiveert is."

